  "description": "RAJWOQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H66 Gd4 N2 O28,C1 H2 Cl2,1.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.784-3.866 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.18-109.31°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd4(μ3-OH)2(o-van)4(O2CC(CH3)3)4(NO3)2]·CH2Cl2·1.5H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
